PART 3: EVEN-SECTOR PROJECTIONS <u_k, K^2 c> & EXACT RESOLVENT QUOTIENTS (N = 24)
==========================================================================================================
Testing the exact commutator identity for excited even bound states:
    Delta_{even, k} * <u_k, K^2 c> = -D_0 * b_k   <===>   <u_k, K^2 c> = - (D_0 * b_k) / Delta_k
and verifying tau_k = (d_k * b_k) / Delta_k == - d_k * <u_k, K^2 c> / D_0:

